<title>CHINA: Earthquake detected off Japan's Hokkaido - HK.</title>
<headline>Earthquake detected off Japan's Hokkaido - HK.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>An earthquake measuring 6.0 on the Richter scale was detected in northern Japan, the Royal Hong Kong Observatory said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The epicentre, recorded at 1616 GMT on Monday, was off the east coast of Hokkaido about 58 km (36 miles) east of Nemuro, Japan. The Royal Observatory gave no further details.</p>
